br([["trained sowldiers for Brad- ward iq rent Munland porsion cheefe rent 1638 October 12 at the faier? 29 he died this day 29 31 at All Saints church November 2 rent the last that I shall pay 3 tooles Disbursements, October \u2014 November 1638 I paid Humfrey Matts of Warton, by the Justeses", [79, 307, 199, 277], [80, 358, 236, 327], [80, 408, 235, 377], [80, 458, 164, 428], [81, 533, 100, 501], [81, 699, 147, 675], [83, 810, 239, 781], [81, 868, 210, 831], [82, 1086, 186, 1057], [83, 1136, 148, 1111], [84, 1307, 171, 1274], [83, 1362, 238, 1329], [87, 1416, 125, 1385], [82, 1467, 176, 1438], [82, 1517, 169, 1487], [83, 1582, 125, 1550], [82, 1632, 203, 1603], [82, 1690, 213, 1653], [83, 1747, 124, 1715], [84, 1857, 120, 1825], [83, 1907, 289, 1878], [82, 1957, 197, 1928], [82, 2023, 282, 1990], [82, 2077, 101, 2045], [82, 2193, 147, 2169], [81, 2243, 203, 2214], [81, 2293, 262, 2264], [81, 2351, 140, 2323], [83, 2463, 99, 2431], [81, 2519, 180, 2489], [458, 192, 1325, 148], [390, 324, 1324, 279]], ["of Peace their apointment, for his training daies; I & Thomas Nicholls of Warton maintain him: Gave Sir Humfrey Baskerviles keeper, brought me half a doa from from [sic] the knight: Gave a boy that drove a score of ship from Kintley: Paid William Eysham, tanner, 6 months rent for the upper stable & barn, due at Miklmas, 1638:", [390, 380, 1191, 334], [389, 430, 1124, 390], [389, 479, 655, 445], [390, 546, 1271, 501], [389, 601, 1162, 556], [390, 657, 1365, 611], [390, 710, 1237, 666], [390, 765, 1338, 722]], ["Deliverd Edward Munkland, in part of the porsion I gave his wyfe at their mariage: For cap paper\u2014ld; for a brazen basting ladle\u201414d: For a brazen chell & a little candlstick: For a new ridle\u20144d, & sparrow bills\u20142d: Paid the canons rent for Prichets howse, Miklmas, 1638: 13li 13s 5d tru cast", [390, 821, 1205, 777], [390, 877, 1147, 832], [391, 936, 1378, 888], [391, 990, 1124, 939], [391, 1041, 1185, 998], [391, 1095, 1417, 1053], [787, 1198, 1130, 1164]], ["Heryford dissbursments Gave Maud Prichetts maid, Margrit: Paid Thomas Pivinche for making me 2 paier of spanish lether shuse, the lether my owne: For a pownd of shugger to send Mrs Eaton when her sonn, Fittzwilliam, lay on his death bed: For 6 lemons to send him also: Paid Ned Parsons for qininge the well side", [390, 1315, 832, 1274], [391, 1426, 1086, 1383], [390, 1481, 1248, 1438], [391, 1536, 1215, 1493], [392, 1590, 1215, 1548], [390, 1646, 1334, 1603], [392, 1692, 971, 1659], [391, 1755, 1192, 1713]], ["and breking blocks, 2 daies: Gave Elyzabeth Acton\u20141s; & Anne Godsalle\u20146d: Gave Simon Reece his wyfe for dressing my sete: Gave my cosin Harbert Jeffreys: Given ould Wellington the almes man: To Dewell for 2 new cloth sadles, stirops bridles, girths & sadle clothes: Deliverd Mr Peter Nash, to pay Mr Lingens", [391, 1810, 914, 1768], [391, 1865, 1358, 1823], [391, 1920, 1305, 1878], [391, 1975, 995, 1933], [391, 2030, 1117, 1988], [390, 2085, 1151, 2043], [390, 2140, 956, 2098], [390, 2195, 1225, 2153]], ["half years rent for the Free Towne, due at Miklmas, 1638: Given the huntsman of Ersley, Ovington, for wodcox: Gave Goody Mary Powell\u20146d; & Goody Harpers maid\u20142d: Given Mrs Birts maid\u20144d; & Ned Harris\u20142d: To Thomas Bedford to pay for a hatchet, an awgger, 2 cheesells & 3 gymmlet bitts: To Thomas Seaburn, apotycary, for an antidot:", [390, 2250, 1415, 2207], [390, 2304, 1408, 2262], [390, 2360, 1345, 2318], [389, 2406, 586, 2373], [390, 2467, 1284, 2427], [389, 2525, 1376, 2483], [389, 2580, 946, 2538], [388, 2635, 1280, 2592]], ["\u00b0 This refers to the entry re Maud Pritchett\u2019s maid. 155 13s 4d 5s 20s 20s 15d 4d 6d 2s [f. 28v] 6d 4s 6d 20d 9d 18d 18d 4d 10s 6d 37s 6d 3hi 18d 8d 6d", [79, 2880, 924, 2842], [1627, 190, 1698, 151], [1482, 483, 1596, 450], [1479, 593, 1514, 561], [1477, 759, 1536, 726], [1477, 869, 1536, 836], [1481, 924, 1543, 891], [1475, 978, 1521, 945], [1477, 1034, 1521, 1001], [1477, 1089, 1513, 1056], [1477, 1317, 1600, 1275], [1477, 1418, 1520, 1385], [1475, 1528, 1571, 1495], [1476, 1637, 1542, 1605], [1476, 1692, 1520, 1659], [1480, 1802, 1542, 1769], [1480, 1856, 1541, 1824], [1475, 1911, 1519, 1879], [1480, 1966, 1534, 1934], [1476, 2021, 1519, 1988], [1477, 2131, 1593, 2098], [1477, 2240, 1519, 2207], [1480, 2295, 1541, 2263], [1476, 2405, 1519, 2372], [1476, 2460, 1519, 2428]]]);
